[{"title":"林亭玩月","author":"吕渊","text":"林亭明月趣偏嘉，知是滇南好事家。\n一片寒光清属影，十分秋色瑩无瑕。\n翠盘香露翻金粟，荷盖西风老桂花。\n恍似水晶宫殿里，几回忘却在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32217,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪屋焚香","author":"吕渊","text":"吟窝新结小崆峒，静爇名香趣不穷。\n四壁晴云生夜白，一星温火吐春红。\n水晶帘静诗魂爽，银叶炉深鼻观通。\n睡起只疑春色暮，满帘飞絮月朦胧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32218,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草砌铺茵","author":"吕渊","text":"东风芳草正芊芊，匝砌铺茵亦可怜。\n叠翠不当车马径，生香偏近绮罗筵。\n蒙茸雅称游人坐，葱茜犹宜醉客眠。\n想见明公行乐处，只疑身在碧云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32219,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花台簇绣","author":"吕渊","text":"春满亭台日乍长，百花开遍斗新妆。\n锦屏高映秋千索，金缕深围蹴鞠场。\n几阵轻风娇弄影，一番微雨细生香。\n东翁最喜留宾醉，更爇银灯看海棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32220,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太华来青","author":"吕渊","text":"排空高插净无埃，万朵芙蓉映日开。\n拄笏岚光和露滴，卷帘晴翠扑人来。\n地连金马岧峣耸，势压青螺宛转回。\n我欲题诗最高处，凌风飞上紫霞堆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32221,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商山耸翠","author":"吕渊","text":"重重秀色翠模糊，展出天边一画图。\n瀑布喜看飞壑泻，荡胸时见断云孤。\n千寻玉柱排青笋，九叠金屏上锦芜。\n最爱初经风雨后，满林香雾乱禽呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32222,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景","author":"吕渊","text":"绿树桥头路转回，水光山色映楼台。\n扁舟荡入荷花里，知是游人避雨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32223,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题便面","author":"吕渊","text":"碧天如洗月团团，露滴松梢夜气寒。\n记得画船经赤壁，酒醒诗就倚篷看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32224,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋徽宗潇湘鸲鹆图","author":"吕渊","text":"御墨淋漓玉数枝，画图潇洒使人悲。\n春风鸲鹆湘江景，不似龙沙夜雪时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32225,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿郭道士山房","author":"顾禄","text":"珠宫夜无喧，潇洒绝壁下。\n天高露气澄，溪净月光泻。\n孤吟虚馆秋，独宿空山夜。\n何当谢九尘，笙鹤拥高驾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32226,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云巢歌为陈焕文赋","author":"顾禄","text":"我本云间人，夙契云山缘。\n闻公巢云处，爱作云巢篇。\n公家云巢在何许，会觇秀出云海边。\n山头日月白云起，云峰万朵浮青莲。\n山人结屋入云去，置身直上云松巅。\n云萝千尺覆户外，槛下百道来云泉。\n云翁住其下，日与云周旋。\n或携云鹤游，或伴云龙眠。\n飧云英兮漱云液，被云衣兮驾云軿。\n有时看云发高咏，落笔往往凌云烟。\n浮云世事岂能绊，萧散自是云中仙。\n我欲乘云走相觅，云路峻绝难夤缘。\n尔来山人弃云出，我今亦是青云客。\n云骑桥南古汴津，一笑相逢云水白。\n问公别云今几年，侧身东望云茫然。\n又挂云帆拂沧海，归去自种云中田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32227,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"顾禄","text":"一寒一暑相推移，四序平分秋最悲。\n山川萧条草木萎，金风淅沥吹罗帷。\n夜何长兮昼何促，欲眠不眠叹幽独。\n楼上寒更声断续，飞蛾翩翩绕残烛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32228,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊舟夷陵","author":"顾禄","text":"落日官船驻驿亭，秋风城郭古夷陵。\n秦烧旧土犹存黑，禹凿高山半拥青。\n万里风波劳远涉，九霄云路阻飞腾。\n令人却忆文章守，夜向西嵓接梦灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32229,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"光霁堂 其二","author":"平显","text":"我公黔宁嗣，世济忠孝美。\n容光照隙罅，于焉烛斯理。\n怅望珠履荣，老客思未已。\n何当驾长风，一溯秋万里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32230,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双峰","author":"桂彦良","text":"平车晨过杜湖岭，喜见屹立之双峰。\n千里松风奏韶濩，一泓秋色潜蛟龙。\n仙禽古树集梵刹，细草幽花迎竹筇。\n斋馀晏坐山阁静，夜深隔屋闻疏钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32231,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陶诗二首 其一","author":"桂彦良","text":"蛟龙作云雨，蜉蝣出以阴。\n小大各有适，胡然愁予襟。\n架插千卷书，壁挂无弦琴。\n希贤复希圣，视古犹视今。\n所贵生世间，动止为人钦。\n有琴莫厌弹，有酒莫厌斟。\n穷居见高节，寡和乃希音。\n谁能言嗫嚅，强颜随冠簪。\n子云媚新室，立言徒艰深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32232,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陶诗二首 其二","author":"桂彦良","text":"神龙困渊蛰，野鹤凌空飞。\n飞潜不同调，一喜复一悲。\n我生悟物理，独立恒无依。\n饮酒得真趣，读书探指归。\n匪为究穷达，亦复知荣衰。\n前贤有遗则，行行慎无违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32233,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次黄参政渔乐韵","author":"顾悫","text":"溪头黄云晚不雨，柳阴无人棹歌起。\n芙蓉数朵溪上山，蒲萄万顷溪之水。\n锦鳞玉尺扬文澜，畅饮谁识银瓶乾。\n归来白月满蓬户，夜深梦落磻溪湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32234,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骝马歌","author":"顾悫","text":"荧惑宫中一团火，踢倒祝融掣金锁。\n飞来尘世化赪虬，满背红云结花朵。\n绛鬃拂膝朱尾长，赤瑛络胸红丝缰。\n炎光闪闪照人热，渴死造父愁王良。\n北平公子宛庭簿，万镒黄金求赤兔。\n黄罗抺首裤摺靴，虎气逼人如吕布。\n江南书生力不多，一跃五丈飞官河。\n相看马上失声笑，但见碧烟如鸟过。\n电光拂眼腾朱梭，骏快不数生蛟鼍。\n研朱为写红叱拨，唤起杜陵为我歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32235,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张鍊师归鸣皋","author":"顾悫","text":"宝匣龙章御敕开，仙师辞阙返蓬莱。\n凤池剑影随云化，鹤背松声带月回。\n火候不须调药灶，仙名今已著丹台。\n柏枝烧罢应多暇，报我蓝田长玉栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32236,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题推篷图","author":"顾悫","text":"记得当年访老逋，扁舟载雪过西湖。\n香浮水面涵清浅，影落篷窗半有无。\n玉树忽惊春漏泄，冰花相照月模糊。\n谁将一段真消息，收拾归来作画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32237,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐明皇吹玉箫图","author":"金湜","text":"昭阳殿高清昼长，珊瑚枕压七宝床。\n珍簟平铺碧云冷，珠帘半捲秋风凉。\n此事谏疏非无补，君王自喜教歌舞。\n旧曲翻成阿滥堆，别调新传玉箫谱。\n玉箫一曲度薰风，宫商十指何玲珑。\n碧沼游鱼窥菡萏，丹霄彩凤鸣梧桐。\n梨园子弟多白发，承宣独喜王番绰。\n手提玉版不停敲，足踏青蒲恣欢谑。\n双双粉黛谁家女，霓裳细拂鲛鮹缕。\n敛袖低眉不动尘，似解呜呜曲中语。\n从来声色侈人心，人生乐极悲亦深。\n岂料箫声入云去，化作渔阳鼙鼓音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32238,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河间府瀛海驿写竹遂成长句","author":"金湜","text":"我本东南瀛海客，乘兴来登瀛海堂。\n堂中开帘分广席，四壁拂拭如秋霜。\n老夫见此发长啸，便觉清风满穹昊。\n呼童捉笔破水墨，胸中恍惚窥天造。\n何须巧作铁钩锁，何须苦效金错刀。\n大竿小挺恣挥洒，千枝万叶分秋毫。\n何须坐对湘江雨，何须去踏淇园春。\n清泉白石漱寒玉，琅玕翡翠排青云。\n云气淋漓墨犹湿，隔窗似听湘娥泣。\n兔翻鹘落魉魅愁，一夜轰雷破春蛰。\n蛰龙振起风怒号，苍烟翠雾翻波涛。\n鲸鲵带雨走平陆，鼋鼍跋浪声嗷嗷。\n从来造化不可测，呼吸阴阳在顷刻。\n筼当谷口冥烟开，白日龙来作人立。\n黄堂太守人中英，慇勤置酒当前庭。\n大觥小觥迭相举，宾僚进退如诸生。\n我亦平生好奇绝，为作长歌歌一阕。\n楼头羌管落天风，笔底惊蛇走冰雪。\n歌罢出门呼驿吏，叮咛窗户须常闭。\n只恐天工有使来，一朝捲入空中去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32239,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文华殿入直","author":"金湜","text":"秘殿深沈凤阁东，中官催召宠恩隆。\n露分仙掌蔷薇绿，酒赐宫壶琥珀红。\n咫尺龙颜呈日表，从容天语出渊衷。\n侍臣才调皆班马，独愧抽毫赋未工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32240,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登多景楼","author":"金湜","text":"滚滚江流动地来，重重楼阁任天开。\n行当草罢平边诏，乞取青山作钓台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32241,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五更转咏促织鸣东壁送友人","author":"郑惟广","text":"一更风露清，东壁寒蛩鸣。\n所怀离别人，独坐伤我情。\n二更人愈愁，声声近床头。\n昨日携手妤，今夕在他州。\n三更月正圆，促织尔何然。\n欲梦见容颜，展转不得眠。\n四更更漏迟，唧唧鸣声悲。\n含情不可听，复起坐孤帏。\n五更声欲残，霜落空林寒。\n其如远人何，相思路漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32242,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"郑惟广","text":"君不见江上山，峨峨绝顶人莫攀。\n又不见门前水，日夜东流何时已。\n邻家少妇长叹息，青鸾日掩心相忆。\n春来花鸟每关情，夫婿年年为军役。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32243,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之去矣三首 其一","author":"郑惟广","text":"自君之去矣，日夜长相思。\n思君如朝露，湛湛能几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32244,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之去矣三首 其二","author":"郑惟广","text":"自君之去矣，春草迷江路。\n思君如流水，一别经几度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32245,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之去矣三首 其三","author":"郑惟广","text":"自君之去矣，好鸟鸣芳树。\n思君如春花，香色何时曙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静夜思","author":"郑惟广","text":"中夜起徘徊，天空月如洗。\n为忆闺中人，渺渺湘江水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征诗","author":"郑惟广","text":"九重命下靖边陲，万里秋风汗马肥。\n剑气横空销瘴雾，日华绚綵动旌旗。\n豺狼已遁深山迹，虎旅方扬上国威。\n功纪太常应有日，都人遥听凯歌归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"戴浩","text":"昨日伤风独倚楼，今朝倚槛又悲秋。\n桃花乍吐蒸霞烂，枫叶随飘逐水流。\n明日清风惟我得，落霞孤雁向谁收。\n伫看覆手须臾顷，赢得虚名老白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏春","author":"戴浩","text":"九十春光似酒浓，隔帘香暖小桃红。\n杖藜缓步寻芳草，閒逐黄鹂过水东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏秋","author":"戴浩","text":"西风满路桂花香，吹彻天街似水凉。\n独坐南窗读周易，半轮明月照空梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓闻莺","author":"戴浩","text":"东风微度栗留声，羌笛轻调百啭清。\n唤起春光无觅处，柳堤花坞雾冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月梅 其一","author":"戴浩","text":"忽睹残花满玉台，恍如鳞甲印苍苔。\n也知摇落难留处，几度春来取次开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月梅 其二","author":"戴浩","text":"一抹轻烟拨不开，䑃朦淡淡锁妆台。\n仙肌犹自无颜色，何日添容傅粉腮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月梅 其三","author":"戴浩","text":"六花飘落五花开，两白交辉绝点埃。\n花神不怕寒侵骨，能占江南百卉魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风烟雪月梅 其四","author":"戴浩","text":"一轮明月照长安，万斛珠玑镜里看。\n莫道我家无好处，一帘清气满阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李陵咏","author":"张楷","text":"李陵入匈奴，自恃将家子。\n眼空沙漠群，气弱天下士。\n转战驱懦兵，贪功入深垒。\n杀气惨云日，笳鼓昏未已。\n苦将死敌争，坐使家声靡。\n堂堂飞将军，夫岂卫律比。\n远意欲有为，偷生以含耻。\n对案不能食，殊方忍居此。\n霜寒塞雁鸣，雪冻白草死。\n迢遥望妻孥，灭没谁与理。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老将行","author":"张楷","text":"少侍武皇亲幸时，天闲赤骠寻常骑。\n当围一箭落双隼，万口啧啧称男儿。\n天山夜捣单于垒，茐岭朝倾颉利师。\n琵琶帐底金凿落，刁斗营前铁蒺藜。\n穰苴岂解知合变，孙武何曾识偶奇。\n当时只拟名不朽，誓向藁街悬贼首。\n相如白璧还奉君，晋鄙兵符夺悬肘。\n谩说三徵出草莱，谁誇百步穿杨柳。\n运筹不数张文成，决计浪传陈户牖。\n长笑廉颇惟善饭，也知樊哙徒誇酒。\n蹉跎世事若浮云，阃外传喧寂不闻。\n帐下争趋新号令，道傍谁识旧将军。\n对客龙钟羞讲武，逢人磬折学谈文。\n壁上蟏蛸翳双剑，门前鸟雀散三军。\n愿得子方怜老马，还同魏尚叙前勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白头吟","author":"张楷","text":"君弹绿绮琴，妾赋白头吟。\n君意都忘弦上语，妾词空写心中素。\n昔日还同得水鱼，今朝忽若经霜树。\n妾颜比少未成衰，君心已改少年时。\n弃置文鹓逐鸡鹜，旧事尽乖新事宜。\n妾意将君比明镜，一物何曾照双影。\n风中柳絮未曾粘，浪里浮萍那得定。\n君岂东流去不返，缺月终期有时满。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"各东西","author":"张楷","text":"天涯别我东复西，行行各自念前路。\n惟有飞尘逐马蹄，今宵两下宿何处。\n不识君安并汝苦，去日渐远路渐长，几夜梦中或相语。\n飞云上山泥入地，一人一身原自异。\n风吹云影落泥中，到底相亲不相弃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴宫怨","author":"张楷","text":"江空月冷天如水，铜龙漏咽沈檀死。\n宫中粉黛一千人，白眼相看娇妒起。\n自入朱帏并翠户，几番曾得君王数。\n君心好恶自不常，岂在区区歌与舞。\n宫门倚天铃索垂，冻霜吹老青桐枝。\n玉銮隐隐背墙去，何人邀得君王归。\n君前岂无容妾地，旧剑犹存肯终弃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陇头吟","author":"张楷","text":"玉门将军秦陇客，十载不归头半白。\n夜闻陇水忆秦关，晓土城头听羌笛。\n笛声呜咽送边愁，陇水滔滔日夜流。\n壮士三千豪气尽，家人翘首望封侯。\n年年虚建平边策，依旧黄沙陇水头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚次乐乡县","author":"张楷","text":"故国一千里，他乡此独征。\n乱山依远戍，寒日下孤城。\n灯火曕程远，川原入望平。\n不堪回首处，孤雁入云鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游少林寺","author":"张楷","text":"步入金沙地，相邀坐竹林。\n僧归青嶂寂，龙卧碧潭深。\n石涧流春乳，松堂落午阴。\n高怀殊未已，临别更沈吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和赋得暮雨送李胄","author":"张楷","text":"微雨沧波路，孤舟薄暮时。\n雁迷归浦早，云湿度江迟。\n白日青山暝，芳洲碧草滋。\n纷纷到华发，相看总成丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张将军","author":"张楷","text":"百战功何在，荒城夕照间。\n角声千骑尽，弓影一灯閒。\n见月思临塞，因风想出山。\n当年青海上，犹记突围还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游塞","author":"张楷","text":"别泪堕如丝，含情折柳枝。\n晚风花落处，寒日马嘶时。\n记里知前路，占程定后期。\n百年能几日，强半惜分离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛阳道中","author":"张楷","text":"洛阳大道上，日暮香风多。\n下客驻巾舄，上客停佩珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"魏宫词","author":"张楷","text":"乍起金鱼钥，閒登铜雀台。\n新欢犹未极，落日苦相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"张楷","text":"忽得三巴信，郎归未有期。\n只言风浪险，不是薄情儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻张逸人","author":"张楷","text":"绿溪五里十里，隔水三家四家。\n借问先生何处，柴门流水桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长信宫词","author":"张楷","text":"久忘恩幸不成思，每听和銮意亦疑。\n翠辇自经长乐去，伤心无奈月明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和酒泉太守席上醉后作","author":"张楷","text":"高台秉烛看剑舞，四坐欢声杂鸣鼓。\n酒阑罗袖动轻寒，门外萧萧杏花雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"张楷","text":"浮云日日蜀山头，石濑年年蜀水流。\n家住瞿塘三峡下，惯经风浪不知愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"周旋","text":"悲风起高树，阴云蔽朝阳。\n伊人在天末，地远道路长。\n驾言欲相就，车敝马玄黄。\n秋深气愈厉，孤雁正南翔。\n爰附尺素书，以寄我衷肠。\n飞高影渐没，蹙刺心内伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠姚惟东","author":"周旋","text":"菶菶梧桐树，敷阴南山麓。\n大枝立青铜，小枝横绿玉。\n朝晞旭日光，暮来凤凰宿。\n爰抱琴瑟材，屡睨中郎目。\n雕斲縆朱弦，清商宣妙曲。\n音响发至和，宇宙调玉烛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山行","author":"周旋","text":"马色林间路，山花作阵飞。\n东风如有意，吹去点征衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西庄晚望","author":"周旋","text":"野水漫凫汀，烟芜接远坰。\n数峰青抹黛，遥指不知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝","author":"周旋","text":"玉漏九门通，银灯万点红。\n鸣珂齐百辟，飞盖拥重瞳。\n烽燧三边静，车书万国同。\n侍臣封事少，退食每从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]